WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
Your eyes that look far off
into the distance

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
They're listening to the voice
within your heart

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
Embracing a moon still blue

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
Your strength to keep on running

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
Will open another new door for you

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
What should we be searching for?

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
Send out your soul

01:07.560 --> 01:14.300
We'll meet here again someday
if that's the truth

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
Upon what should we fix our gaze?

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
Let it go, let's believe in it

01:31.450 --> 01:33.660
The Sanzo party is traveling northwest

01:33.660 --> 01:35.920
roughly seven kilometers
from our location.

01:36.460 --> 01:38.430
Looks like we've caught up
to them easily,

01:38.430 --> 01:40.520
thanks to them trundling along
in a stupid car.

01:41.530 --> 01:43.830
What are our orders from
Gyokumen Koushu?

01:44.330 --> 01:47.100
Send in more assassins, she says.

01:47.100 --> 01:49.470
Though I think that will be
pretty pointless.

01:49.470 --> 01:50.700
Of course it is!

01:51.510 --> 01:55.040
How many of my men have died to
no purpose because of them?!

01:55.040 --> 01:57.710
Doesn't she understand that we
can't win through numbers?

01:57.710 --> 01:59.350
Calm down!

01:59.350 --> 02:02.050
That's what we're having this
strategy session for, remember?

02:02.050 --> 02:05.020
Oh, you're so indecisive, Brother.

02:05.020 --> 02:08.050
We should just go and take care
of them ourselves!

02:08.560 --> 02:12.550
I know. We have no choice but to fight
if I am to save my mother.

02:13.230 --> 02:14.290
But...

02:15.100 --> 02:19.330
Kou, are you sure you're not
still hesitating?

02:19.330 --> 02:20.800
About doing as that bitch says,

02:20.800 --> 02:22.940
and taking part in the
revival experiments?

02:22.940 --> 02:26.200
Don't be ridiculous! I know exactly
what needs to be done!

02:27.180 --> 02:28.700
Lord Kougaiji...

02:29.410 --> 02:30.740
Yaone...

02:33.080 --> 02:36.180
Won't you please allow me to go?

03:06.780 --> 03:08.370
Thank you for waiting!

03:09.380 --> 03:11.550
Direct frontal attacks, such as
the ones we have sent so far,

03:11.950 --> 03:13.920
have no hope of defeating
the Sanzo party.

03:13.920 --> 03:15.790
I have an idea.

03:15.790 --> 03:17.730
That is dangerous. I will not allow it.

03:17.730 --> 03:22.000
Why not? I, Yaone, am dying
to be of service to you.

03:22.000 --> 03:24.470
I would like to return the favor that
was done for me that day.

03:24.470 --> 03:25.430
However...

03:25.430 --> 03:29.240
Besides which, I am your
attendant apothecary.

03:29.240 --> 03:31.640
I am capable of manipulating
many powders,

03:31.640 --> 03:33.730
whether they be poisons or explosives.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.650
Do as you like.

03:37.650 --> 03:39.110
Thank you very much!

03:39.110 --> 03:42.880
On one condition! Their actions
are not always what they seem.

03:42.880 --> 03:45.390
They may seem absentminded,
but it is impossible

03:45.390 --> 03:47.420
to comprehend what they
might do next.

03:47.420 --> 03:49.120
Take no risks.

03:49.120 --> 03:51.290
Yes, Lord Kougaiji.

03:54.430 --> 03:58.800
This is the only tavern in the
direction of their travels.

03:58.800 --> 04:01.770
They are sure to visit
this establishment.

04:01.770 --> 04:05.110
In other words, if I get ahead of them
and pretend to be a waitress,

04:05.110 --> 04:08.040
then all I have to do is put poison
in the dishes they order.

04:08.710 --> 04:09.770
But...

04:10.280 --> 04:11.800
Miss, one more plate of xiaolongbao!

04:12.750 --> 04:14.080
More beer over here too!

04:14.080 --> 04:16.920
Yaone, when you're done
over there, take these too.

04:18.050 --> 04:20.680
Why does it have to be so busy?!

04:25.630 --> 04:27.630
What are you doing?!

04:27.630 --> 04:31.030
Oh, come on, it's not like
it'll wear out!

04:35.170 --> 04:36.870
What the hell did you do that for?!

04:36.870 --> 04:40.280
Who was it?! Hey! Who the hell
did it?! Come on out, damn it!

04:40.280 --> 04:42.840
I'll beat the living daylights out of you!

04:42.840 --> 04:44.710
That's the Sanzo party.

04:44.710 --> 04:47.200
Miss, we'd like to order!

04:48.180 --> 04:49.580
Coming!

04:49.580 --> 04:51.090
Sweet-and-sour pork, liver and
scallions, prawns in chili sauce,

04:51.090 --> 04:52.250
A bottle of beer.
Sweet-and-sour pork, liver and
scallions, prawns in chili sauce,

04:52.250 --> 04:52.520
Sweet-and-sour pork, liver and
scallions, prawns in chili sauce,

04:52.520 --> 04:53.690
and crab cakes, fried noodles...

04:53.690 --> 04:54.920
Shut up, you monkey!

04:54.920 --> 04:57.230
Will that be all?

04:57.230 --> 04:59.690
Oh, and an ashtray.

05:02.400 --> 05:05.160
Each table is set with an ashtray,
but this one isn't here.

05:05.500 --> 05:07.700
Could that mean the person who
helped me out just now...

05:08.470 --> 05:11.770
No, it can't be. I needn't show
mercy to my enemy.

05:13.940 --> 05:16.040
So, what do you make of it?

05:16.040 --> 05:17.670
Make of what?

05:18.250 --> 05:21.820
It'll be one month today since
we left Chang'an.

05:21.820 --> 05:23.850
We've defeated as many demons
as there are stars

05:23.850 --> 05:27.020
and most of them were assassins
sent by Kougaiji.

05:27.520 --> 05:30.510
We know that Kougaiji is
the son of Gyumaoh.

05:31.030 --> 05:35.300
But as a rule, demons don't
take orders from anyone,

05:35.300 --> 05:38.170
and yet, they show a great deal
of loyalty towards Kougaiji

05:38.170 --> 05:41.400
and act in a controlled and
organized manner.

05:42.040 --> 05:44.540
It's been quiet lately,

05:44.540 --> 05:47.340
so they'll probably launch another
attack of some sort soon.

05:47.340 --> 05:50.450
In the end, we haven't learned
anything at all.

05:50.450 --> 05:52.710
Not the purpose of the experiments
to revive Gyumaoh,

05:52.710 --> 05:55.150
nor the person behind all this.

05:55.150 --> 05:56.210
Excuse me...

05:56.790 --> 05:59.480
Thank you for waiting.
Here's your order.

05:59.890 --> 06:01.290
Yay!

06:03.220 --> 06:06.690
Well, they do say that you can't
fight on an empty stomach.

06:06.690 --> 06:08.290
Apparently...

06:09.730 --> 06:12.220
This smells super yummy!

06:13.600 --> 06:16.770
These are the poisoned dishes
that I prepared.

06:16.770 --> 06:18.570
And now, without a doubt...

06:19.640 --> 06:21.540
Thanks for the food!

06:24.680 --> 06:27.480
Oh, don't be like that,
come drink with us.

06:27.480 --> 06:29.580
No! Please let me go!

06:31.050 --> 06:33.920
Normally, I could beat this guy up
in a second, but right now...

06:33.920 --> 06:35.450
Ouch! Owowowow!

06:36.360 --> 06:40.120
I would advise you to give it up, since
she doesn't seem very willing.

06:40.900 --> 06:43.870
You bastard! Don't think you'll
get away with this!

06:43.870 --> 06:47.370
Mister, are you looking to get hit
with another ashtray?

06:47.370 --> 06:49.000
Clang, right here?

06:49.000 --> 06:51.540
Clang? So you're the one
that threw the ashtray?!

06:51.540 --> 06:53.060
You bastard!

06:55.840 --> 06:57.440
Oh, how could you?!

07:02.120 --> 07:06.880
Now you've gone and done something
that you're never supposed to do!

07:07.160 --> 07:10.230
There is no way you're
getting away with this!

07:10.230 --> 07:12.690
Food grudges are terrible
things, aren't they?

07:12.690 --> 07:14.230
That stupid monkey.

07:14.230 --> 07:16.900
What? Damn brat, you wanna fight?!

07:16.900 --> 07:18.000
You're toast!

07:18.000 --> 07:19.090
Get them!

07:22.470 --> 07:23.870
How dare you?!

07:24.510 --> 07:28.770
What's the point of fighting humans
on top of demons?

07:29.040 --> 07:31.450
They are so full of youthful energy.

07:31.450 --> 07:32.710
What are you sitting back
and relaxing for?!

07:32.710 --> 07:34.310
You guys are their friends too, right?!

07:37.390 --> 07:39.350
You're not very steady on your feet.

07:39.350 --> 07:41.620
Smashed already, you drunkard?

07:42.120 --> 07:44.460
Don't mess with us!

07:46.130 --> 07:47.650
Sirs!

07:48.030 --> 07:50.500
Please stop! My tavern!

07:56.940 --> 08:01.010
The actions of the Sanzo party are
not always what they seem,

08:01.010 --> 08:03.500
that's what Lord Kougaiji said, but...

08:04.080 --> 08:05.680
They really are different.

08:05.680 --> 08:09.010
These people are just fundamentally
different, I think.

08:09.450 --> 08:12.980
You shouldn't let it bother you,
because it's not your fault.

08:14.520 --> 08:15.650
But...

08:20.600 --> 08:23.500
We can't let these guys get away with
sexual harassment, now can we?

08:34.910 --> 08:39.010
Hey, stop right there. Where are
you taking that woman?

08:39.550 --> 08:41.070
Your Highness!

08:41.450 --> 08:43.590
She's apparently the daughter
of a medicine merchant,

08:43.590 --> 08:44.820
but because of her beauty,

08:44.820 --> 08:47.910
she is to be presented
to Hyakugan Maoh.

08:52.630 --> 08:55.060
I like her.

08:56.100 --> 08:57.530
I'll take her.

08:57.530 --> 08:59.760
What? Your Highness...

09:03.100 --> 09:07.770
Hyakugan Maoh toys with beautiful
women like playthings,

09:08.140 --> 09:10.110
then eats them when he becomes
bored with them.

09:10.550 --> 09:12.050
Don't get me wrong.

09:12.050 --> 09:16.420
I didn't do it to save you. You'll
work for me from now on.

09:17.390 --> 09:21.010
As an apothecary, of course.
Do you understand?

09:27.300 --> 09:30.090
Yes, Lord Kougaiji.

09:34.500 --> 09:36.200
Thank you very much.

09:37.840 --> 09:40.140
That's right, from that day forth,

09:40.140 --> 09:42.880
my life has been with Lord Kougaiji.

09:42.880 --> 09:44.570
I must accomplish my mission.

09:45.180 --> 09:47.180
Why am I hesitating?

09:47.180 --> 09:48.840
These men are the enemy.

09:49.680 --> 09:52.980
Lord Kougaiji's enemies
are my enemies!

09:58.590 --> 10:03.550
Still standing? You're
pretty tough, Mister.

10:04.070 --> 10:08.160
Damn straight! We're not built thin
like you guys!

10:19.010 --> 10:20.610
Damn, my head's suddenly...

10:20.980 --> 10:22.610
My vision's getting dimmer.

10:23.080 --> 10:25.090
Smells like medicine.

10:25.090 --> 10:26.880
Do not breathe in this mist!

10:35.600 --> 10:38.930
Gojyo! Please hang in there, Gojyo!

10:39.800 --> 10:41.560
Sanzo! Goku!

10:45.010 --> 10:47.110
He's breathing normally.

10:47.110 --> 10:48.280
This is...

10:48.280 --> 10:52.580
Right, please do not worry.
This is just sleeping powder.

10:53.550 --> 10:56.480
Outsiders should not be dragged
into this, after all.

10:56.480 --> 10:58.920
You did this?

10:58.920 --> 11:01.980
So you didn't inhale the powder.

11:02.960 --> 11:06.980
Why is that? Of all of them, I most
wanted you to be asleep.

11:12.700 --> 11:14.690
A demon power limiter!

11:26.850 --> 11:31.010
Then you are also one of
Kougaiji's assassins!

11:31.820 --> 11:36.020
Master Cho Hakkai of the
Sanzo party, I presume.

11:36.390 --> 11:37.960
My name is Yaone.

11:37.960 --> 11:40.090
For my Lord Kougaiji,

11:40.860 --> 11:45.320
you will all die, here and now!

11:54.880 --> 11:59.370
Yes, it is all for Lord Kougaiji.

12:00.520 --> 12:01.880
En garde!

12:01.880 --> 12:03.350
Wait a minute...

12:04.790 --> 12:05.780
I have you!

12:19.030 --> 12:21.190
Why don't we stop this already?

12:25.540 --> 12:26.540
Explosives?!

12:26.540 --> 12:27.770
Please just die!

12:30.010 --> 12:31.480
A defensive wall?!

12:31.480 --> 12:32.970
Please give up now!

12:40.420 --> 12:41.860
Huh?

12:41.860 --> 12:44.220
Hey, Sanzo! Wake up, Gojyo!

12:44.890 --> 12:46.380
Man, that hurts!

12:46.630 --> 12:49.860
What the hell's going on here?

12:50.470 --> 12:52.160
Hey, why's he...

12:52.670 --> 12:54.790
Why's he fighting?

12:56.770 --> 12:58.860
Fine, then I'll have to use
my last resort.

12:59.870 --> 13:01.510
That is...

13:01.510 --> 13:05.250
Honestly, I did not want to do more
damage than necessary,

13:05.250 --> 13:08.510
but I set a bomb inside that tavern.

13:09.850 --> 13:12.180
With one push of this button...

13:16.420 --> 13:17.580
What?!

13:19.660 --> 13:23.100
Well, were you talking about this?

13:23.100 --> 13:25.430
I'm sorry, but I found it
just a while back

13:25.430 --> 13:28.460
and I thought, "How dangerous,"
so I defused it.

13:31.840 --> 13:33.640
I've lost completely.

13:33.640 --> 13:35.510
I'm such an idiot.

13:35.880 --> 13:39.470
I underestimated both the enemy
and what it means to fight.

13:41.950 --> 13:46.610
I'm very sorry for my
counterattack just now.

13:46.990 --> 13:48.680
Are you hurt at all?

13:53.560 --> 13:54.690
Don't touch me!

13:55.860 --> 13:57.300
Miss Yaone...

13:58.400 --> 14:02.700
Not only am I defeated, but my
enemy shows me mercy too.

14:02.700 --> 14:06.800
I am not worthy of returning
to Lord Kougaiji's service!

14:10.010 --> 14:13.670
I have no need of this life any more!

14:14.520 --> 14:15.450
Wait!

14:15.450 --> 14:17.250
Stay away!

14:17.250 --> 14:18.550
Lord Kougaiji,

14:19.050 --> 14:22.850
I am so sorry for having been
useless to you to the very end.

14:26.360 --> 14:28.350
You idiot, don't do it!

14:31.470 --> 14:33.000
Gonou...

14:33.000 --> 14:34.590
Gonou, listen to me.

14:35.500 --> 14:40.600
In my belly, is the child
of that filthy monster.

14:41.980 --> 14:43.580
So...

14:43.580 --> 14:44.940
Kanan...

14:45.750 --> 14:48.480
Farewell, Gonou.

14:50.280 --> 14:53.050
Farewell, Lord Kougaiji.

14:53.050 --> 14:54.020
Stop...

15:09.040 --> 15:10.830
Lord Kougaiji!

15:13.670 --> 15:14.940
Kougaiji?!

15:21.320 --> 15:23.550
You're the Sanzo party?

15:25.120 --> 15:26.550
This guy's...

15:27.420 --> 15:30.160
I have come to retrieve
my subordinate.

15:30.160 --> 15:31.850
That is my only business.

15:33.730 --> 15:36.200
I'm sure we will eventually
meet again.

15:36.830 --> 15:40.160
You had better take care
to stay alive until then.

15:40.740 --> 15:42.040
Wait up!

15:42.040 --> 15:46.030
You came all this way, so don't
be shy! Stay and play!

15:46.810 --> 15:47.710
Kai!

15:55.080 --> 15:56.340
Goku!

16:04.030 --> 16:05.960
Child's play.

16:06.330 --> 16:08.800
Hey, now, is he for real?

16:10.160 --> 16:12.430
I suppose it's my turn now?

16:24.510 --> 16:25.910
That's enough.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.850
Good of you to climb up here.

16:32.550 --> 16:35.090
My clothes are dirty now,
because of you.

16:35.090 --> 16:38.390
Thanks for the flashy greeting.

16:38.390 --> 16:40.120
A banishing gun...

16:41.630 --> 16:46.030
I've got a ton of questions
for you, Your Highness.

16:46.030 --> 16:50.170
Sorry, but we can continue
this another time.

16:50.170 --> 16:53.660
We'll hit people's homes
if we fight in this area.

16:54.140 --> 16:57.340
I apologize for my men's
rudeness in the past.

16:57.710 --> 17:01.650
But since you insist on trying
to thwart our plans,

17:01.650 --> 17:04.650
I will not fail to eliminate you.

17:04.650 --> 17:09.720
I'm not very sociable, so I'd like it
if we kept it short.

17:11.560 --> 17:13.190
My sentiments exactly.

17:16.460 --> 17:20.900
It's the first time I've felt a will
to kill that wasn't evil.

17:23.940 --> 17:26.300
Are you all right, Goku?

17:26.970 --> 17:29.200
He's strong!

17:30.040 --> 17:34.450
He's humongously strong!
This is totally awesome!

17:34.850 --> 17:36.750
That look on his face...

17:36.750 --> 17:39.950
It's the look of a brat that's
found a new toy.

17:39.950 --> 17:42.660
I'm glad he seems so happy.

17:42.660 --> 17:44.460
Well, he made me look like a dork,

17:44.460 --> 17:47.030
so I wouldn't mind seeing
him again either.

17:47.030 --> 17:50.050
But we still weren't able to get
any information out of him.

17:50.500 --> 17:53.560
No, I think we now know one thing.

17:55.540 --> 17:57.400
The reason why Kougaiji

17:57.400 --> 18:00.900
is such a charismatic presence
among the demons.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.740
Are you hurt?

18:07.580 --> 18:09.310
No, I am all right.

18:10.120 --> 18:13.310
I am so very sorry, Lord Kougaiji!

18:14.560 --> 18:18.860
Not only did I fail my mission,
but then to be saved by you...

18:19.990 --> 18:21.860
For all that has happened,

18:21.860 --> 18:23.930
please allow me to atone
with my life.

18:23.930 --> 18:25.190
Don't be ridiculous!

18:26.030 --> 18:28.270
I don't recall taking anyone
into my service

18:28.270 --> 18:30.290
that was stupid enough to
throw their own life away!

18:31.910 --> 18:35.580
You made a promise to follow me
to the ends of the Earth.

18:35.580 --> 18:37.340
Do you mean to break it?

18:39.950 --> 18:44.850
No, I shall always be by your side,
Lord Kougaiji.

18:46.120 --> 18:48.210
Till the day I die.

18:55.300 --> 18:56.920
It's chilly tonight.

18:57.830 --> 18:59.490
Sanzo...

19:01.740 --> 19:06.570
I guess it's already been three years
since we met.

19:08.540 --> 19:11.610
What? It's only been three years?

19:11.610 --> 19:14.080
It feels like it was a hell
of a long time ago.

19:15.680 --> 19:17.340
Now that you mention it...

19:18.850 --> 19:22.490
I was just recalling this and that,

19:22.490 --> 19:25.220
not that I'd ever really forgotten them.

19:26.160 --> 19:31.770
Hakkai, if you want to bring closure
to what happened back then

19:31.770 --> 19:34.030
in the form of revenge or something,

19:34.440 --> 19:36.900
you don't have to force yourself
to come on this journey.

19:37.610 --> 19:40.700
You should follow the path
that you want to follow.

19:42.780 --> 19:48.680
You're right, but I'm here right now
because I want to be.

19:49.180 --> 19:50.680
Besides...

19:50.680 --> 19:53.620
Sanzo, I wanna sleep in this room!

19:53.990 --> 19:57.790
He drew stuff on my feet
while I was asleep!

19:57.790 --> 20:01.660
I can't sleep because
you snore so loud.

20:01.660 --> 20:04.230
I don't ever wanna share a room
with Gojyo again!

20:04.230 --> 20:06.100
I wouldn't ask you to, you monkey!

20:06.100 --> 20:07.600
Don't call me a monkey!

20:07.600 --> 20:10.570
Hey, then what are you, an idiot?!
Yeah, you look like an idiot!

20:10.570 --> 20:10.940
I ain't an idiot either!

20:10.940 --> 20:12.070
You noisy bastards! Day in and day
out, haven't you had enough?!
I ain't an idiot either!

20:12.070 --> 20:15.340
You noisy bastards! Day in and day
out, haven't you had enough?!

20:15.340 --> 20:17.440
I'm gonna shut you guys up!

20:18.210 --> 20:19.470
Scary!

20:20.110 --> 20:24.250
Man, you got Sanzo mad at us!
You better do something about it!
And raising kids is much easier
when you have a daycare worker.

20:24.250 --> 20:24.990
Man, you got Sanzo mad at us!
You better do something about it!

20:24.990 --> 20:25.690
Man, you got Sanzo mad at us!
You better do something about it!
Right, Mr. Guardian?

20:25.690 --> 20:27.090
We got scolded because
you're an idiot!

20:27.090 --> 20:28.320
No kidding.

20:28.320 --> 20:31.430
What?! Besides, Sanzo got mad
because of you!

20:31.430 --> 20:33.730
Sure, shift the blame to the
other guy, you bastard!

20:33.730 --> 20:35.700
You're not a guy, you're a water sprite!

20:35.700 --> 20:37.670
Don't call me a water sprite,
you stupid monkey!

20:37.670 --> 20:41.030
All right now, children,
it's beddy-bye time.

20:42.700 --> 20:48.730
That's right, even sudden
tragedies come

20:49.110 --> 20:54.240
Looking good-natured, without
cause for suspicion

20:54.680 --> 20:59.950
Don't complain, just shut up

20:59.950 --> 21:03.260
And look up

21:03.260 --> 21:09.260
I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is

21:09.260 --> 21:14.600
Before any talk of dreams or hopes

21:14.600 --> 21:20.040
It's probably the same for everyone

21:20.040 --> 21:24.000
You must fight against yourself

21:30.920 --> 21:34.560
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:34.560 --> 21:36.760
Repeating is one change

21:36.760 --> 21:40.790
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:40.790 --> 21:44.730
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:44.730 --> 21:47.570
Go forward now

21:47.570 --> 21:52.540
Standing next to the taut pressure

21:52.540 --> 21:57.980
I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone

21:57.980 --> 22:03.450
It's probably the same for everyone

22:03.450 --> 22:07.510
You must fight against yourself

22:17.400 --> 22:18.830
Next Saiyuki

22:19.900 --> 22:22.000
When someone you really
like is in trouble,

22:22.000 --> 22:24.170
not being able to help
is dorky and it sucks

22:24.170 --> 22:26.010
and I bet you'd regret it
for the rest of your life!

22:26.010 --> 22:29.310
But having to fight a life or death
battle with that guy

22:29.310 --> 22:31.050
would be even worse!

22:31.050 --> 22:34.180
Sanzo, this guy's an old
friend of yours, right?

22:34.180 --> 22:35.580
Then why...

22:35.580 --> 22:38.350
Next Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
"Unnatural Talismanic Monk"

22:38.350 --> 22:39.790
Next Time
Unnatural Talismanic Monk
